takeaways
+ it's about / something is about，这是关于.....、这件事是关于.....、大约
  ```text
  it's a story about        # 强调是一个 ......... 的故事
  the story is about        # 强调这个故事讲的是 xxxxxxxxxx
  it's about wood           # 这是关于木头的.
  it's about 10 minutes.    # 大约 10分钟.
  money is about.           # 钱是关于 ...... 的.
  ```
+ like A more than B，比起 B，更喜欢 A
  ```text
  like Banana more than Apple.
  ```
+ prefer A to B，更喜欢 A 而不是 B
  ```text
  I prefer Banana to Apply.
  I prefer eating at home to eating out.
  I prefer playing games to watching movies.
  ```